"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312422_1993508647951143_7664415987782945520_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=arnC8QKykQIQ7kNvwEzv4y_&_nc_oc=Adp8PSP7CeK7r6Pr4lyI7Tzy2lZ49KxyPElBXzAGRzI_TjeazrCYd4IZ-LUG9hCldBo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM-Q9sTPe-D64pdHZvpnrptfwKHRVH-RJE0bcc1En-BoQ&oe=6AC7B893"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Trivia World Quest", "keywords": ["Trivia", "Quiz", "Explore", "Family", "Adventure"], "long_description": "Knowledge becomes adventure.\n\nStep into Trivia World Quest, a unique VR experience that transforms classic trivia into an immersive journey of exploration, discovery, and challenge.\n\nTravel through beautifully crafted worlds filled with mysteries, puzzles, and interactive environments. Answer questions across multiple categories including Science, History, Geography, Nature, Sports, Literature, and Entertainment to unlock new paths and progress through the adventure.\n\nBut knowledge alone won't be enough. Climb towering obstacles, solve clever riddles, master physical challenges, and interact with the world around you as you advance through increasingly engaging levels.\n\nDesigned exclusively for VR, Trivia World Quest combines learning, action, and exploration into a seamless experience that's easy to pick up, rewarding to master, and fun to replay.\n\n# Features\n\n\u2705 Explore stunning, immersive worlds\n\n\u2705 Hundreds of questions across multiple categories\n\n\u2705 Solve puzzles and riddles to unlock new areas\n\n\u2705 Physical VR gameplay including climbing, archery, and object interaction\n\n\u2705 Progressive difficulty and replayable content\n\n\u2705 Family-friendly fun for players of all ages\n\n\u2705 A fresh evolution of the classic trivia genre\n\nHow far will your knowledge take you?\n", "short_description": "Explore stunning worlds, answer trivia, solve puzzles, and conquer challenges in an immersive VR adventure."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1208536385670446", "locale": "pt_PT", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Trivia World Quest", "keywords": ["Trivia", "Quiz", "Explorar", "Aventura", "Fam\u00edlia"], "long_description": "O conhecimento transforma-se em aventura.\n\nEntra no Trivia World Quest, uma experi\u00eancia \u00fanica de Realidade Virtual que reinventa o cl\u00e1ssico jogo de quiz, transformando-o numa jornada imersiva de explora\u00e7\u00e3o, descoberta e desafio.\n\nViaja por mundos cuidadosamente desenhados, repletos de mist\u00e9rios, puzzles e ambientes interativos. Responde a perguntas de diversas categorias, incluindo Ci\u00eancia, Hist\u00f3ria, Geografia, Natureza, Desporto, Literatura e Entretenimento, para desbloquear novos caminhos e avan\u00e7ar na aventura.\n\nMas o conhecimento, por si s\u00f3, n\u00e3o ser\u00e1 suficiente. Escala obst\u00e1culos, resolve enigmas, supera desafios f\u00edsicos e interage com o ambiente \u00e0 tua volta para progredir atrav\u00e9s de n\u00edveis cada vez mais envolventes.\n\nDesenvolvido de raiz para Realidade Virtual, Trivia World Quest combina aprendizagem, a\u00e7\u00e3o e explora\u00e7\u00e3o numa experi\u00eancia fluida, intuitiva e divertida, concebida para ser jogada vezes sem conta.\n\n# Caracter\u00edsticas\n\n\u2705 Explora mundos imersivos e visualmente impressionantes\n\n\u2705 Centenas de perguntas em m\u00faltiplas categorias\n\n\u2705 Resolve puzzles e enigmas para desbloquear novas \u00e1reas\n\n\u2705 Mec\u00e2nicas VR com escalada, arco e flecha e intera\u00e7\u00e3o f\u00edsica com objetos\n\n\u2705 Dificuldade progressiva\n\n\u2705 Divers\u00e3o para toda a fam\u00edlia\n\n\u2705 Uma nova evolu\u00e7\u00e3o do g\u00e9nero trivia\n\nAt\u00e9 onde te levar\u00e1 o teu conhecimento?", "short_description": "Explora mundos deslumbrantes, responde a perguntas, resolve puzzles e supera desafios numa aventura imersiva em Realidade Virtual."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mobilesolutions.pt/privacy-policy-terms-services/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://mobilesolutions.pt/privacy-policy-terms-services/", "publisher_name": "WalkMe Mobile Solutions", "support_website_url": "https://mobilesolutions.pt/contact-us/", "website_url": "https://mobilesolutions.pt/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "pt"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "27491740977104065"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1195479942669135"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1195479942669135"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1782400320, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1195479942669135"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27491676893777140", "version": "1.0.0"}, "id": "830153629046777", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7934842936553827", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27491676893777140"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_rele